{'symbol': 'PYPL', 'date': '2023-02-17 16:30:00', 'title': 'PAYPAL ANNOUNCES NEW EMPLOYEE INDUCEMENT GRANTS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF. , FEB. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PAYPAL HOLDINGS, INC. (NASDAQ: PYPL) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS GRANTED EQUITY AWARDS ON FEBRUARY 15, 2023, UNDER ITS 2022 INDUCEMENT EQUITY INCENTIVE PLAN (THE "PLAN") TO NEW EMPLOYEES WHO JOINED PAYPAL.'}